table for use with moisture sensitive stone.","heading":"IMPORTANT CONSIDERATIONS","source":{"doc_type":"PDS","url":"https://aus.sika.com/content/dam/dms/au01/x/sikatile-410-secureset.pdf","page":2,"page_end":2,"doc_version":"September 2023, Version 01.04","section":"IMPORTANT CONSIDERATIONS","web_url":"https://aus.sika.com/en/construction/tile-stone-installationsystems/tile-adhesives/sikatile-410-secureset.html"}},{"id":"sikatile-410-secureset:suitability:c8d1f102","type":"suitability","polarity":"no","conditional":false,"tags":{"substrate":["waterproofing_membrane"]},"mentions":[],"text":"SikaTile®-410 Secure Set is not suitable for direct bonding of tiles over solvent based waterproofing membranes.","heading":"IMPORTANT CONSIDERATIONS","source":{"doc_type":"PDS","url":"https://aus.sika.com/content/dam/dms/au01/x/sikatile-410-secureset.pdf","page":2,"page_end":2,"doc_version":"September 2023, Version 01.04","section":"IMPORTANT CONSIDERATIONS","web_url":"https://aus.sika.com/en/construction/tile-stone-installationsystems/tile-adhesives/sikatile-410-secureset.html"}},{"id":"sikatile-410-secureset:suitability:a12d39b3","type":"suitability","polarity":"no","conditional":false,"tags":{"substrate":["existing_tiles"],"environment":["submerged"]},"mentions":[],"text":"Not suitable for tile over tile in submerged applications.","heading":"IMPORTANT CONSIDERATIONS","source":{"doc_type":"PDS","url":"https://aus.sika.com/content/dam/dms/au01/x/sikatile-410-secureset.pdf","page":2,"page_end":2,"doc_version":"September 2023, Version 01.04","section":"IMPORTANT CONSIDERATIONS","web_url":"https://aus.sika.com/en/construction/tile-stone-installationsystems/tile-adhesives/sikatile-410-secureset.html"}},{"id":"sikatile-410-secureset:restriction:f84ae77d","type":"restriction","polarity":"no","conditional":false,"tags":{},"mentions":[],"text":"SikaTile®-410 Secure Set is not suitable for tile and stone with resinous, or other coatings on the base of the tile or stone","heading":"IMPO